{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-04_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-04","title":"探查岩洞区域","storyCode":"14-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"835426ba1ec4da1d330e45cbc6797ca8742d7f49af9536431b2ee4b5d90ddd98","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"伦蒂尼姆外围地块，荒废的宅邸"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她回来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真该死！能躲开那些魔族佬就已经够不容易的了，怎么她不仅没死，还能找到我们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是怎么知道，我之前和那些魔族佬做过生意的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，反正那些魔族佬现在也不管你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，你是怎么落到她手上的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她用弩顶着我的脑袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前就认识她，她那个时候可没这么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没这么，什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不满的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，我没有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"为公爵们干了一辈子活的私兵瘫倒在地，一把弩支在他的额头上，闪着寒光的箭尖抵着他的脑袋。\n来人的声音冷漠如冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是——对、对不起，“铣痕”小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不该——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"弩箭洞穿了他的耳廓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的人会给自己宠物的耳朵上打孔，来证明它的归属。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，人不是宠物。但......某些方面也都一样，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，爬起来，给我一个结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我让你们干的事情怎么样了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的，“铣痕”小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们尽可能汇总了情报。监听站的信号很差，我们只能竭尽所能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只要结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从“灰礼帽”残留的信息，和偶尔能拦截到的通讯来看，确实有一支叫“典范军”的队伍成立了，领导人很可能就是您说的那位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“维娜”小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们似乎正在前往......银石崖前线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......银石崖。他们居然还真的留在了战场上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续。有什么新的消息随时通知我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的私兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，其实干这些事，比我原本预想的要轻松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为，我会有更多负担呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用顾忌什么，也不用扮演什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到“维多利亚”了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"浓重的阴影中，一道赤红的光芒闪烁了几下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的职责，不就是守护她吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"行动开始后四十三小时"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道，你还是会来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......厄尔苏拉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去几十个小时里，那个喜欢玩炸弹的W来过一次，为我精心打造了这个监狱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊内丝来过两次，表达了一下对我的“关怀”。她还是老样子，一旦注意力放在别人影子上，呛人的时候反应就会慢一拍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在轮到你了？又想来说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你考虑好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个问题应该我问你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的处境岌岌可危，唯一能指望的载具瘫痪在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我作为驾驶员，很可能掌握着什么你们不知道的秘密，说不准什么时候就会偷袭你们一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你真的应该杀了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更希望你能用你知道的情报来帮我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说梦话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就拒绝过你，你要是觉得我被你们俘虏就能改变立场，那你就太瞧不起我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......三条命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡兹戴尔的时候，你救过我们三次。我一次，伊内丝两次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是你在日记本上记的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算个价吧，我想办法还给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你就算不当雇佣兵回卡兹戴尔开家小店，也会赔到血本无归的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是希望，能活着回到卡兹戴尔的萨卡兹，尽可能多一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真宏大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得了，事到如今，疤痕商场的老规矩，就把它丢在卡兹戴尔地底吧。我们之间的账，一笔勾销。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一次劝诫，赫德雷。现在不杀我的话，你一定会后悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄尔苏拉，你有没有想过，我们的目标从来都是一致的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了。你那些正确的理论我都听腻了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想用漂亮话买我的命，老朋友。这没比钱强上多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵是没有立场......但你和我，早就不只是雇佣兵了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊内丝，打个赌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷会和厄尔苏拉聊聊过去疤痕商场的情谊，厄尔苏拉要求他尽快动手，然后过不了多久赫德雷就会一脸惆怅地回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要赌什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这个反应？我还以为放他们两个单独相处，你会狠狠吃醋来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再盯着我的影子反复欣赏了，伊内丝，我烦得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子和维多利亚人走了好久了吧......也不知道他们那边怎么样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这骨头架子还在装死，特雷西斯搞出来的浮夸天灾又阴魂不散，也不知道曼弗雷德是不是下一秒就会蹦出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......本来炸死特雷西斯的机会都近在眼前了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，我知道你还在因为特蕾西娅的事躁动。可你最好确保你的炸弹脑袋冷静下来，我们现在要准备的事还有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*萨卡兹粗口*！谁说我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，有些状况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了换班的时候，我们派出去侦察的人，有些没回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“吊塔”那一队，十个人去峡谷北边了。现在联系不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是遇到能干的术师了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们最后一次联络是在什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多三个小时前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果敌人能让一整支佣兵队伍悄无声息地消失，他们这会应该已经打过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，现在最重要的任务还是守好脊椎，不要轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面有状况，我们就这么坐在这干等？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意伊内丝的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们对外面战场的情况一无所知，最稳妥的战术是集中力量防守一处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没那么多废话，我的人平白无故地消失了，总要有个理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是迷路了就带他们回来，要是遇见敌人就提前干掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点！万一是敌人分散我们战斗力的陷阱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讨厌陷入被动......我主动出击，就算是陷阱，也可以先用炸弹炸得他们现身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给我半天时间，要是我没回来，那就一定是遇到了难对付的家伙，其他人不要再追过来，全力防守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是期间收到了阿米娅的通讯，也不用管我，你们立即启动脊椎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不耽误其他人工夫，我自己带队过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们几个，带好家伙，我们走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g18_originiumcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们来的就是这个地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按理说就是这个方向，我们往峡谷北边深处走，只看到有这个山洞，不知道里面是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是条密道？这里会不会是什么王庭军藏宝贝的秘密据点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里要真的是王庭军的秘密基地，我们掉下来的第一时间就会有两百个血魔和食腐者围过来唱咒术歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按之前可露希尔给的消息，我们大概是在伦蒂尼姆西边的荒山里，离老家伙们的正面战场还远得很呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是话说回来，总觉得有一股......（嗅闻）......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人待过的老旧到发霉的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我讨厌古老的东西，但赫德雷一定会喜欢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我猜猜看，我们的这些幸运儿是碰上了什么敌人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，你什么时候用炸弹了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么胡话？我们一路过来什么时候用炸弹了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"墙壁上这些灼痕......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，能把石头烧成这样，但又没有法术的痕迹？这是在做什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听到了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一惊一乍干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打铁......我听到了有人在打铁——这里有人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么胡话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少在那吓唬自己，这里明明半个人影都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W......我们还要往里面走吗？我感觉有点不太对劲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"废话，我们出来是干什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟着我的那些姑娘小子们身上用的都是上等货，我还没富裕到眼睁睁看着那些装备烂在地下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有听说过一个萨卡兹的传说......在奎隆都还没有出生的时候，萨卡兹曾经跟红龙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上历史课的有赫德雷一个就够了，再多说一句，我就先把你扔到前面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W小队成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1336_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有股血的味道......但不是萨卡兹的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不久前才留下的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戒备！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1335_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吼————————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
